 "instruction_head": "/app is the NumeriForge scientific experiment platform. Review `/app/docs/legacy_api.md` to understand the current interface, and `/app/docs/reproducibility_spec.md` for the full reproducibility requirements.\n\nThe platform currently has no reproducibility guarantees \u2014 all stochastic experiments use a shared global random source seeded at startup, results lack integrity checksums, the comparison framework only supports exact float equality, and the verify command is a stub.\n\nBring the platform up"
